:: School Changing Wait
<<effects>>

<<set _temp_minute to (60 - Time.minute)>>
<<pass _temp_minute>>

You wait outside the changing rooms, until the sound of lockers opening and closing fills the room. They become more rapid and panicked. It isn't long before you hear students talking in low, worried voices.
<br><br>

<<link [[남자아이들을 엿본다|School Changing Swap Boys]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[여자아이들을 엿본다|School Changing Swap Girls]]>><</link>>

:: School Changing Swap Boys
<<effects>>

당신은 탈의실로 슬쩍 들어간다. 아이들은 너무 당황한 나머지 당신이 빈 사물함 안에 숨는 것을 눈치채지 못한다.
<br><br>
"누가 옷을 잘못 둔 것 같아. 잠깐. 이거 치마잖아. 뭐야?"
<br>
"야, 내 바지 봤어?"
<br>
"이 셔츠는 나한테 너무 작은데, 줄어들었나?"
<br><br>
An uproar builds. Most of the <<worldMale 'boys' 'girls'>> seem flustered, but a couple seem fascinated.
<br><br>
"이제 어떡하지? 수영복 차림으로 복도를 걸어 다닐 수는 없잖아!"
<br>
One of the smaller <<worldMale 'boys' 'girls'>> speaks up. "Well—" <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> swallows. "These clothes follow the dress code. We shouldn't get in trouble if we—"
<br><br>
<<worldMale "He's" "She's">> cut off as a larger <<worldMale 'boy' 'girl'>> shoves <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>> against a closed locker.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|School Changing Swap Boys 2]]>><</link>>

:: School Changing Swap Boys 2
<<effects>>

"If you're so eager," the larger <<worldMale 'boy' 'girl'>> says, "you first."
<br><br>
The smaller <<worldMale 'boy' 'girl'>> stammers for a moment. All eyes are on <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>>. You stifle a giggle as <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> pulls a skirt over <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> swim trunks. One of the <<worldMale 'boys' 'girls'>> encourages <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>>, and then another joins. The tension in the room drops.
<br><br>
"Hey, you don't look half bad in that." A firm slap to the rear reddens <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> face even further. <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> is pushed towards the door. "Wh-what about the rest of you?"
<br>
"네가 망을 봐야지. 아무도 못 들어오게."
<br><br>
The other <<worldMale 'boys' 'girls'>> begin to get dressed. Some of them take to it better than others. The largest <<worldMale 'boy' 'girl'>> looks ridiculous. Another rips three shirts before finding a fit.
<br><br>
One by one, the <<worldMale 'boys' 'girls'>> exit the changing room. They are hesitant at first, but soon enough, you are left alone in the room.
<br><br>

